  "audience_note": "<b>Mixed week:</b> sessions and users both jumped YoY this week (+22.9% / +26.8%), powered almost entirely by a surge in new visitors (+54.7%) &mdash; but the returning-visitor base kept shrinking (returning users &minus;23.8%), pulling repeat-visit share down to 39.4% from 50.1% a year ago. YTD, repeat-visit share still edges out last year (49.3% vs 48.7%), the lone bright spot, while page views, engagement rate, and session duration all remain softer YoY both this week and YTD.",
